      "source": [
        "**Punto 11:** Identifique posibles valores atípicos (outliers) en al menos una columna numérica usando el criterio de rango\n",
        "intercuartílico (IQR). No es obligatorio eliminarlos, pero sí reportarlos. Para este punto hago el reporte manual\n",
        "basándose en las operaciones vistas en clase."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "3-5tsP6MA1TT"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Para este punto, se utilizará la columna: ***Fare***\n",
        "\n",
        "Se calcula Q1 y Q2"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "dS7VJ_53k7h8"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "Q1 = df_titanic['Fare'].quantile(0.25)\n",
        "Q3 = df_titanic['Fare'].quantile(0.75)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"Q1 (25%): {Q1}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Q3 (75%): {Q3}\")"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "ljMh60VJgtNV",
        "outputId": "8230b668-48ef-4024-dd16-d676029d0720"
      },
      "execution_count": 76,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Q1 (25%): 7.9104\n",
            "Q3 (75%): 31.0\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Calculando el IQR = rango donde se concentra el 50% central de pasajeron en cuanto a tarifa pagada"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "JkuGB57GlCnm"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "IQR = Q3 - Q1\n",
        "print(f\"IQR: {IQR}\")"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "iDvpDQhug4R3",
        "outputId": "91654221-8796-4b2e-e8f5-d507e8f1545a"
      },
      "execution_count": 77,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
